msgid "Of the game (written to Kenshi's settings.cfg) and of the launcher. Kenshi's own translations, plus Meitou's where they exist."
msgstr "游戏（写入 Kenshi 的 settings.cfg）与启动器的语言。使用 Kenshi 自带的翻译，再加上 Meitou 已有翻译的部分。"

