msgid "Don't offer this version again; a newer one will be"
msgstr "不再提示这个版本；有更新版本时会再提示"

msgid "Unstable: daily builds of the newest code, untested. They may crash or corrupt save files; off, only full releases are offered."
msgstr "不稳定：每日构建来自最新代码，未经测试，可能崩溃或损坏存档；关闭后只提供正式版。"

