msgstr "边缘如何平滑。"

msgid "The sky's light in shade, at night and indoors."
msgstr "阴影处、夜间和室内的天光。"

msgid "Depth on the ground and smoother rocks and hills, from tessellation and parallax."
msgstr "用曲面细分和视差让地面有真实的起伏，岩石和山丘更平滑。"

msgid "Safe: a fixed 5120 MB; the guard shortens ranges and evicts caches sooner."
msgstr "安全：固定 5120 MB；保护机制会更早缩短距离并清出缓存。"

msgid "Auto: about a third of this Mac's memory, from 5120 to 10240 MB, so a larger Mac keeps more resident."
msgstr "自动：约为这台 Mac 内存的三分之一（5120 至 10240 MB），内存更大的 Mac 能常驻更多内容。"

msgid "Metal memory budget: automatic."
msgstr "Metal 显存预算：自动。"

msgid "Auto: Vulkan."
msgstr "自动：Vulkan。"

msgid "Auto: {1} (Vulkan loader found)."
msgstr "自动：{1}（已找到 Vulkan 加载器）。"

msgid "Auto: {1} (no Vulkan loader)."
msgstr "自动：{1}（没有 Vulkan 加载器）。"

msgid "Auto: {1}."
msgstr "自动：{1}。"

msgid "Metal (native)."
msgstr "Metal（原生）。"

msgid "Metal is not available on this Mac; Auto uses Vulkan."
msgstr "这台 Mac 不支持 Metal；自动会使用 Vulkan。"

msgid "Vulkan (MoltenVK loader found)."
msgstr "Vulkan（已找到 MoltenVK 加载器）。"

msgid "Vulkan loader not found. Use Auto/Metal or install it with Setup."
msgstr "没有找到 Vulkan 加载器。请选择自动或 Metal，或用安装向导安装它。"

msgid "Vulkan loader not found; choose Auto/Metal, or install it later in Settings."
msgstr "没有找到 Vulkan 加载器；请选择自动或 Metal，或稍后在设置里安装。"

msgid "Balanced: more resident detail than Safe, with some headroom for macOS and other apps."
msgstr "平衡：常驻细节比安全档更多，同时给 macOS 和其他应用留出一些余量。"

msgid "High: keeps the most textures, terrain and objects resident. Best on a 16 GB-or-larger Mac with other memory-heavy apps closed."
msgstr "高：常驻最多的贴图、地形和物体。最适合 16 GB 或更大内存、并已关闭其他占内存应用的 Mac。"

msgid "Adjust ground relief depth."
msgstr "调整地面浮雕深度。"

msgid "Adjust ground displacement distance."
msgstr "调整地面位移距离。"

msgid "Adjust ground parallax distance."
msgstr "调整地面视差距离。"

msgid "Enable bolt tracers."
msgstr "启用弩箭拖尾。"

msgid "Enable mesh welding."
msgstr "启用网格焊接。"

msgid "Shows a generated frame between each two rendered ones: nearly twice the frames shown, with a little more input delay. Works with TAA, FSR and DLSS upscaling. Turns on and off at start-up."
msgstr "在每两帧已渲染的画面之间生成一帧：显示的帧数几乎翻倍，输入延迟略有增加。可与 TAA、FSR 和 DLSS 放大一起使用。在启动时开启或关闭。"

msgid "FSR 3: AMD's, any GPU, needs the FidelityFX library (amd_fidelityfx_vk.dll, libamd_fidelityfx_vk.so). DLSS: NVIDIA's, Windows with an RTX 40 or later, needs Streamline's frame generation DLLs (sl.dlss_g.dll, nvngx_dlssg.dll, sl.reflex.dll, sl.pcl.dll) and turns Reflex on. Takes effect at start-up."
msgstr "FSR 3：AMD 的方案，适用于任何显卡，需要 FidelityFX 库（amd_fidelityfx_vk.dll、libamd_fidelityfx_vk.so）。DLSS：NVIDIA 的方案，需要 Windows 和 RTX 40 系列或更新的显卡，需要 Streamline 的帧生成 DLL（sl.dlss_g.dll、nvngx_dlssg.dll、sl.reflex.dll、sl.pcl.dll），并会开启 Reflex。启动时生效。"

msgid "Faithful runs the world, then draws it, as the game does. Meitou runs the next world tick while the frame is drawn whenever the world is busy (big fights, crowds), Always on every frame: much higher frame rates with many characters, up to 33 ms more input delay."
msgstr "忠实：先运行世界再绘制，与游戏一致。Meitou／繁忙时：世界繁忙（大混战、人群拥挤）时，在绘制这一帧的同时运行下一个世界步进。Meitou／每帧：每帧都并行，角色很多时帧率会高得多，最多增加 33 毫秒输入延迟。"

