msgid "This is a dangerous wound and is getting worse. If you can regain consciousness before it goes below {1,num} then you could save yourself.\nIf it goes below that then you will have to hope you get rescued by somebody else.\n"
msgstr "这是危险的伤口，而且正在恶化。如果你能在它降到 {1,num} 以下之前恢复意识，还能自救。\n如果再低于那个值，就只能指望别人来救你了。\n"

