msgstr "删除广告牌缓存"

msgid "The bounty will expire in {1,num} hrs"
msgstr "赏金将在 {1,num} 小时后过期"

msgid "A character knocked down or killed by a blow falls with its own momentum and is pushed away from the hit, harder the heavier the blow, its arms and legs flung by it, and a cut-off head flies the same way. Limp bodies have joints that ease to a stop and a slight muscle tone, so they settle into natural poses. In the game a body drops where it stood, its joints stopping hard."
msgstr "被击倒或击杀的角色会随自身惯性倒下，并被撞离受击点：击打越重推得越远，四肢随之外甩，被砍下的头也以同样方式飞出。瘫软的身体关节会缓缓停住、带一点肌肉张力，因此会自然落地。游戏里身体就倒在原地，关节是硬生生停住的。"

msgid "A character on a bench with the table behind it sits facing away from the table. The game mirrors the bench's look point through the middle of the world map, so the sitter faces an unrelated direction."
msgstr "坐在背后有桌子的长凳上时，角色会背朝桌子坐。游戏会把长凳的朝向参考点经世界地图中心镜像，所以坐着的人朝向无关方向。"

msgid "Fighters with martial arts of 20 or less throw their weak punch from a normal punching distance. The game's data gives it a negative reach, so they throw it only when nearly touching their target."
msgstr "武术不超过 20 的角色，弱拳会在正常出拳距离上挥出。游戏数据给的是负攻击距离，所以只有几乎贴到目标时才会挥。"

msgid "Seen into a building your characters are in, parts of other buildings that run through it are left out, such as the Hub's town wall in the Shinobi Thieves tower. The game's world places them there and draws them inside the room."
