msgid "Mods: {1} of {2} loaded"
msgstr "模组：已加载 {1}/{2} 个"

msgid "No character selected"
msgstr "未选择角色"

msgid "Needs first aid"
msgstr "需要急救"

msgid "Conscious"
msgstr "清醒"

msgid "Blood --"
msgstr "血量 --"

msgid "Body --"
msgstr "身体 --"

msgid "CANCEL"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "the game ships SSAO but has it disabled"
msgstr "游戏自带 SSAO 但已禁用"

msgid "against banding in smooth gradients; the game has none"
msgstr "防止平滑渐变中的色带；游戏没有此功能"

msgid "strength 1"
msgstr "强度 1"

msgid "lighter haze keeps far mountains visible"
msgstr "较淡的雾霾让远山保持可见"

msgid "the game uses FXAA; Meitou uses a temporal method (TAA, FSR or DLSS: the Tab panel chooses, FSR and DLSS need their libraries)"
msgstr "游戏使用 FXAA；Meitou 使用时间性方法（TAA、FSR 或 DLSS：在 Tab 面板中选择，FSR 和 DLSS 需要对应的库）"

msgid "soft, far terrain"
msgstr "柔和，远处地形"

msgid "the game draws hard-edged cascades that end abruptly at the shadow range; Meitou fits them to the view, filters them softly with contact-hardening penumbrae, blends the cascades, and lets mountains shadow the land out to the horizon"
msgstr "游戏绘制边缘生硬的级联阴影，并在阴影范围处突然结束；Meitou 让级联贴合视野，以接触硬化半影柔和过滤、混合各级联，并让山脉的阴影一直投到地平线"

msgid "per layer"
msgstr "按图层"

msgid "by size"
msgstr "按大小"

msgid "the game ends all of a layer's meshes at one range (1000 x foliage range for most: trees, ruins, junk and litter alike); Meitou draws large meshes (trees, ruins, wrecks, rock stacks) far, medium ones (junk, boulders, bushes) midway and small ones (litter, small plants) near, each class with its own Tab slider"
msgstr "游戏让一个图层的所有网格在同一距离结束（大多数为 1000 x 植被距离：树木、废墟、杂物和垃圾都一样）；Meitou 将大型网格（树木、废墟、残骸、岩堆）画得远，中型网格（杂物、巨石、灌木）画到中距离，小型网格（垃圾、小植物）画得近，每一类都有自己的 Tab 滑块"

msgid "the game draws every foliage mesh in full out to its range; Meitou draws large and medium meshes beyond the impostor distance (Tab slider) as baked billboards, crossfaded, which also stand in as shadow casters far out"
msgstr "游戏将每个植被网格完整绘制到其距离；Meitou 在替身距离（Tab 滑块）之外将大型和中型网格绘制为烘焙的广告牌，并交叉淡化，它们在远处也充当阴影投射物"

msgid "waves and surf"
msgstr "波浪和浪花"

msgid "the game's water is a flat plane with scrolled normal maps; Meitou adds wind-driven waves, breakers that roll in along the depth, break into foam and run up the beach, and foam on the crests (visual only: the water stays at its height for the game)"
msgstr "游戏的水是带有滚动法线贴图的平面；Meitou 加入风驱动的波浪、随水深涌来并碎成泡沫冲上海滩的碎浪，以及浪峰上的泡沫（仅视觉效果：对游戏而言水面高度不变）"

msgid "full size"
msgstr "全尺寸"

msgid "low resolution"
msgstr "低分辨率"

msgid "the game draws every dust, ash and rain sprite at the full picture size, which is a fill-rate cost when big sprites pile up (a dust storm); Meitou draws the alpha and additive ones into a quarter-area (half per axis) target and blends it back, depth-aware, for a fraction of the cost"
msgstr "游戏以完整画面尺寸绘制每个尘土、灰烬和雨滴精灵，大精灵堆积时（如沙尘暴）会消耗大量填充率；Meitou 将 alpha 和叠加精灵绘制到四分之一面积（每轴一半）的目标中，再按深度混合回去，开销只有一小部分"

msgid "full detail"
msgstr "完整细节"

msgid "generated levels"
msgstr "生成的层级"

msgid "the game draws every foliage mesh at full detail, and TERRAIN-mode rocks and plants (some thousands of triangles each) have no LOD levels; Meitou makes coarser levels at load (quadric edge collapse, kept in a disk cache) and picks one per instance by how many pixels (shadow texels) its deviation would show"
msgstr "游戏以完整细节绘制每个植被网格，TERRAIN 模式的岩石和植物（每个数千个三角形）没有 LOD 层级；Meitou 在加载时生成较粗的层级（二次误差边折叠，保存在磁盘缓存中），并根据其偏差会显示多少像素（阴影纹素）为每个实例选择一级"

msgid "flat ambient"
msgstr "平坦环境光"

msgid "ray-traced probes"
msgstr "光线追踪探针"

msgid "hybrid, graded"
msgstr "混合，调色"

msgid "the game has no tone curve (bright skies and sunlit sand clip flat at white) and no grading; Meitou blends the clip with ACES (the Tab slider sets the share, 0.75) so highlights roll off, then grades saturation 1.06 and contrast 1.05"
msgstr "游戏没有色调曲线（明亮的天空和阳光下的沙地会平平地截断为白色），也没有调色；Meitou 将截断与 ACES 混合（Tab 滑块设置比例，0.75），让高光柔和过渡，再将饱和度调为 1.06、对比度调为 1.05"

msgid "flat haze"
msgstr "平坦雾霾"

msgid "shadowed haze"
msgstr "带阴影的雾霾"

msgid "the game's heat haze shifts distant objects by several pixels in hot weather, which reads as blur; Meitou halves it (the Tab slider sets any strength)"
msgstr "游戏的热浪扭曲在炎热天气中会让远处物体偏移数个像素，看起来像模糊；Meitou 将其减半（Tab 滑块可设置任意强度）"

msgid "black haze"
msgstr "黑色雾霾"

msgid "flat night"
msgstr "平坦夜晚"

msgid "planet light"
msgstr "行星光"

msgid "starfield texture"
msgstr "星空纹理"

msgid "scotopic blue"
msgstr "暗视蓝"

msgid "the game has no grading, so night is the day's saturated browns and oranges, darkened; Meitou shifts dim colour towards the rods' blue-grey as the scene's adapted luminance falls (the Purkinje shift), keeping lamps, fires and the moon in colour (the Tab slider sets the strength)"
msgstr "游戏没有调色，所以夜晚只是白天饱和的棕色和橙色变暗；Meitou 随着场景适应亮度下降，将暗色向视杆细胞的蓝灰色偏移（浦肯野效应），同时让灯、火和月亮保持色彩（Tab 滑块设置强度）"

msgid "on the land"
msgstr "在地面上"

msgid "original ambient"
msgstr "原始环境光"

msgid "bounced light"
msgstr "反弹光"

msgid "with Indirect light enabled, use bounced light indoors; turn this off to keep the original ambient on room surfaces, furniture and indoor characters while outdoor GI stays enabled"
msgstr "启用间接光时，在室内使用反弹光；关闭此项可让房间表面、家具和室内角色保持原始环境光，而室外全局光照仍然启用"

msgid "the meshes' own"
msgstr "网格自带的"

msgid "night only"
msgstr "仅夜晚"

msgid "day and night"
msgstr "白天和夜晚"

msgid "the game's"
msgstr "游戏的"

msgid "8 nearest"
msgstr "最近 8 个"

msgid "terrain only"
msgstr "仅地形"

msgid "walls, floors, objects"
msgstr "墙壁、地板、物体"

msgid "Bloody footprints"
msgstr "血脚印"

msgid "relief march"
msgstr "浮雕步进"

msgid "the game's ground is its height map's mesh; Meitou tessellates the ground near the eye and raises it by the same relief (needs tessellation shaders; visual only: characters walk on the undisplaced ground)"
msgstr "游戏的地面就是其高度图的网格；Meitou 在视点附近细分地面，并以相同的浮雕抬高它（需要曲面细分着色器；仅视觉效果：角色在未位移的地面上行走）"

msgid "per-face tangents"
msgstr "逐面切线"

msgid "welded, averaged tangents"
msgstr "焊接、平均的切线"

msgid "hard-edged, flat"
msgstr "边缘生硬，平坦"

msgid "soft, lit"
msgstr "柔和，受光"

msgid "Contact shadows"
msgstr "接触阴影"

msgid "the game's shadows stop at the cascades' resolution, so small objects float; Meitou adds short sun shadows from the depth, at full resolution, with no noise, on characters too (armour plates, straps, feet on the ground). Off by default: what the screen does not show casts nothing; for the cascades, the Traced sun shadows hold theirs"
msgstr "游戏的阴影受级联分辨率限制，所以小物体看起来像漂浮；Meitou 根据深度添加短的阳光阴影，全分辨率、无噪点，角色也有（护甲片、带子、脚踩地面）。默认关闭：屏幕上看不到的东西不会投射阴影；对于级联，“光线追踪阳光阴影”会保留它们"

msgid "Hybrid GI"
msgstr "混合全局光照"

msgid "Advanced materials"
msgstr "高级材质"

msgid "hair, cloth, skin, eyes, metal"
msgstr "头发、布料、皮肤、眼睛、金属"

msgid "Ground trails"
msgstr "地面痕迹"

msgid "Water contact foam, wakes and ripples"
msgstr "水面接触泡沫、尾迹和涟漪"

msgid "foam, waves"
msgstr "泡沫、波浪"

msgid "Metal on buildings"
msgstr "建筑上的金属"

msgid "metal textures"
msgstr "金属纹理"

msgid "the game's buildings are matte unless a material names a metalness map, and few do; Meitou treats the textures of plate, tank and machinery as metal where they have no colour of their own, so rust and paint stay matte"
msgstr "游戏的建筑都是哑光的，除非材质指定了金属度贴图，而这样的很少；Meitou 将板材、水箱和机械的纹理在没有自身颜色处视为金属，因此锈迹和油漆保持哑光"

msgid "Blood on weapons and gear"
msgstr "武器和装备上的血迹"

msgid "blades, armour, clothing"
msgstr "刀刃、护甲、衣物"

msgid "Gear sway"
msgstr "装备摆动"

msgid "Soft grazing sun"
msgstr "柔和掠射阳光"

msgid "bumps fade"
msgstr "凹凸淡出"

msgid "the game lights every bump of a normal map as if nothing stood between it and the sun, so ground and walls the sun only grazes break into bright and black patches, and bumps stay lit on a surface facing away; Meitou fades the normal map out of the sun's light as the sun nears the surface's own plane (from 24 degrees down to 6), where the bumps would shadow each other"
msgstr "游戏将法线贴图的每个凹凸都当作与太阳之间毫无遮挡来照亮，所以太阳仅掠过的地面和墙壁会碎成明暗斑块，背向的表面上凹凸也保持明亮；Meitou 在太阳接近表面自身平面时（从 24 度到 6 度）让法线贴图淡出阳光照明，那时凹凸本应相互遮挡"

msgid "thin lens"
msgstr "薄透镜"

msgid "darker corners"
msgstr "较暗的角落"

msgid "Ground-truth occlusion"
msgstr "真实环境光遮蔽"

msgid "the Ambient occlusion switch's method (it needs that switch on): Meitou's SSAO is a cheap estimate; GTAO searches each pixel's horizon, measures how much sky it really sees, and keeps the colour of the light that bounces in a corner. Costs more; off by default"
msgstr "“环境光遮蔽”开关的方法（需要打开该开关）：Meitou 的 SSAO 是廉价的估算；GTAO 搜索每个像素的地平线，测量它真正看到多少天空，并保留在角落中反弹的光的颜色。开销更大；默认关闭"

msgid "Lamp shadows"
msgstr "灯光阴影"

msgid "Reflections"
msgstr "反射"

msgid "sky only"
msgstr "仅天空"

msgid "the game's glossy and rain-wet surfaces reflect one fixed sky picture, indoors and under a roof too; Meitou replaces it with what they really mirror (the screen, then a traced ray where the device has them, the sky past both), fading with roughness, and darkens the sky's reflection where the probes see no sky. Water keeps its own reflection. Off by default: not yet seen on a GPU"
msgstr "游戏中光滑和被雨打湿的表面都反射同一张固定的天空图片，在室内和屋顶下也是如此；Meitou 将其替换为它们真正映出的内容（先是屏幕，在设备支持时再用追踪光线，两者之外是天空），随粗糙度淡化，并在探针看不到天空的地方调暗天空反射。水保留自身的反射。默认关闭：尚未在 GPU 上验证"

msgid "Traced sun shadows"
msgstr "光线追踪阳光阴影"

msgid "the game's sun shadows come from cascaded maps, soft or blocky by their texels; Meitou traces a ray to the sun from every lit pixel at every distance, softened by the sun's real size, the same every frame: a shadow is as sharp as it is close to its caster, characters shadow themselves exactly and grass shadows the ground (needs a GPU with ray tracing and Indirect light; off by default)"
msgstr "游戏的阳光阴影来自级联贴图，因纹素而柔和或呈块状；Meitou 在每个距离上从每个受光像素向太阳追踪一条光线，按太阳的真实大小柔化，每帧都相同：阴影离投射物越近就越清晰，角色精确地投射自身阴影，草也会在地面上投下阴影（需要支持光线追踪的 GPU 和间接光；默认关闭）"

msgid "Portrait and editor sun"
msgstr "肖像和编辑器阳光"

msgid "key light"
msgstr "主光"

msgid "fixed sun"
msgstr "固定阳光"

msgid "Character editor bar"
msgstr "角色编辑器酒吧"

msgid "the game stands the character being edited on a platform over bare ground; Meitou can stand it in a bar at night instead, drawn with your graphics settings"
msgstr "游戏让正在编辑的角色站在空地上的平台上；Meitou 可以改为让它站在夜晚的酒吧里，并用你的图形设置绘制"

